{"generated_at":"2026-08-20T02:14:16.109044Z","scope":"week","paper_count":20,"topics":[{"name":"Dust and ISM","count":11},{"name":"Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","count":9},{"name":"Other Selected Research","count":5},{"name":"Galaxy Evolution","count":3},{"name":"Strong Gravitational Lensing","count":2}],"papers":[{"id":"2608.15997","canonical_id":"2608.15997","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"The Koi Pond: A Strongly Lensed Protocluster Core hosting a Diverse Population of DSFGs","authors":["Nicholas Foo","Kevin C. Harrington","Brenda L. Frye","Patrick S. Kamieneski","Melanie Kaasinen","Rafael Ortiz","Alex Pigarelli","Gibson B. Bowling","Belén Alcalde Pampliega","Joe Bhangal","Timothy Carleton","Jianhang Chen","Seth H. Cohen","Camila de Sá-Freitas","Jose Diego","Román Fernández Aranda","Carlos Garcia Diaz","Nikhil Garuda","Eric F. Jiménez-Andrade","Daizhong Liu","James D. Lowenthal","Allison Man","Allison Noble","Massimo Pascale","Francesca Rizzo","Hannah R. Stacey","Amit Vishwas","Q. Daniel Wang","Rogier A. Windhorst","Ilsang Yoon","Min S. Yun","Dazhi Zhou"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文利用JWST和ALMA对强引力透镜原星系团核心PJ0846+15（\"Koi Pond\"）进行观测，揭示了11个处于z=2.67的尘埃恒星形成星系（DSFGs）的多样化性质，包括多种形态特征（旋臂、棒、核球、星团、潮汐尾）、大范围的恒星质量与尘埃消光差异，以及复杂的恒星-尘埃几何结构，表明这类星系经历了多样的演化路径。","date":"2026-08-19","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.15997","score":95,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"high-z galaxy gas","points":20}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing","Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2608.19159","canonical_id":"2608.19159","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"A comprehensive SKA Survey of lensing clusters and lensed galaxies","authors":["Mamta Pandey-Pommier","John McKean","Ian Harrison","Catherine Marion Cress"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文阐述了SKA望远镜将如何通过其前所未有的灵敏度、角分辨率和巡天速度，变革星系团的射电引力透镜研究，实现对暗物质次结构、星系团内介质的非热重子成分以及微央斯基级透镜星系的统计性研究。","date":"2026-08-20","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.19159","score":78,"stars":4,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"cluster gas rather than high-z galaxy gas","points":-18}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing","Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2608.19162","canonical_id":"2608.19162","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Tracing gas outflows in molecular gas-rich galaxies with the SKA","authors":["Mamta Pandey-Pommier","Ramya Sethuram","Chiranjib Konar","Chinnathambi Muthumariappan","Subhashis Roy","Nirupam Roy","Alexandre Marcowith"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文探讨了SKA望远镜如何通过观测中性氢（H I）、分子谱线和射电连续谱，来量化活动星系核（AGN）射电喷流驱动的多相气体流出与反馈能量学，从而揭示射电喷流如何调节冷星际介质和恒星形成。","date":"2026-08-20","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.19162","score":55,"stars":3,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"multi-phase gas","points":16},{"label":"high-z galaxy gas","points":20}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM","Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2608.19007","canonical_id":"2608.19007","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"The progenitors of $z\\gtrsim10$ JWST galaxies in the COLIBRE simulations","authors":["Evgenii Chaikin","Andrew Pontzen","Carlos S. Frenk","Joop Schaye","Shengdong Lu","Robert A. Crain","Anna Durrant"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文使用COLIBRE星系形成模拟，研究了JWST在红移z≳10处发现的大量亮星系（M_UV≲-20），发现这些极端早期星系可以通过标准ΛCDM宇宙学和星系形成物理自然解释，无需对现有模型进行特殊调参。","date":"2026-08-20","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.19007","score":55,"stars":3,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"high-z galaxy gas","points":20}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM","Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2608.12708","canonical_id":"2608.12708","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"ALMA observations of pre-JWST z ~ 10 galaxy candidates: A CO(J = 9-8) line from a ULIRG at z = 2.54 and revisit of the photometric redshifts with JWST photometry","authors":["Suzuka Arai","Yuma Sugahara","Akio K. Inoue","Takuya Hashimoto","Ken Mawatari","Yi W. Ren","Steven L. Finkelstein","John R. Weaver","Rebecca L. Larson","Seiji Fujimoto","Yuichi Harikane","Takahiro Morishita","Yoichi Tamura","Andreas Faisst","Charles Steinhardt","Nima Chartab","Larry D. Bradley","David B. Sanders"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文报告了利用ALMA对六个z~10星系候选体的[OIII]88μm线观测。在UDS_18697中检测到谱线和尘埃连续谱辐射，但后续JWST NIRSpec观测确认其为z=2.54的低红移星系（ULIRG），其余五个候选体多为低红移混杂源。研究进一步探讨了高红移星系颜色-颜色选择准则的改进方法。","date":"2026-08-14","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.12708","score":55,"stars":3,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2608.18897","canonical_id":"2608.18897","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"The efficient star-forming regions of stripped-envelope supernovae","authors":["M. Solar","M. J. Michałowski","J. Nadolny","L. Galbany","J. P. Anderson","J. Sollerman","T. Pessi","E. Zapartas","B. Šlaus","J. Alexander","O. Ryzhov","J. Hjorth","C. Jiménez-Palau","P. Nowaczyk","D. Somawanshi","A. Leśniewska"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.HE"],"summary":"该研究首次通过VLT/MUSE和ALMA观测，利用Hα/Hβ和CO(2-1)发射线分别追踪暖电离气体和冷分子气体，在云尺度（~100 pc）分辨率下计算富氢超新星（H-rich SNe）和剥离包层超新星（SESNe）位置的恒星形成效率（SFE），发现SESNe爆发环境的恒星形成效率比H-rich SNe高8倍。","date":"2026-08-20","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.18897","score":45,"stars":2,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"galaxy gas","points":10}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2608.16802","canonical_id":"2608.16802","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"JWST Whirlpool Galaxy Treasury: Mid-Infrared Emission in M51 and its Relation to Gas Column and Star Formation","authors":["Mansi Padave","Karin M. Sandstrom","Daniel A. Dale","Adam K. Leroy","Eric W. Koch","Tony D. Weinbeck","Angela Adamo","Jessica Sutter","Lindsey Hands","Torsten Böker","Martha L. Boyer","Ryan Chown","Bruce T. Draine","Ilse de Looze","Brandt A. L. Gaches","Simon C. O. Glover","Dario Colombo","Robert C. Kennicutt","Hannah Koziol","Ralf S. Klessen","Sean T. Linden","Desika Narayanan","Alex Pedrini","Julia Roman-Duval","Eva Schinnerer","J. D. T. Smith","Sophia K. Stuber","Fabian Walter"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"利用JWST/MIRI对M51的八波段中红外成像数据，研究了PAH发射和尘埃连续谱与分子气体、原子气体和电离气体（分别由CO(1-0)、HI和Pa-α示踪）之间的相关性。PAH主导波段与CO(1-0)呈近线性相关，表明PAH与气体充分混合；尘埃连续谱主导波段与恒星形成示踪相关，表明中红外同时示踪气体柱密度和恒星形成，但存在波长依赖性的转变。","date":"2026-08-19","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.16802","score":45,"stars":2,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"galaxy gas","points":10}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2608.14473","canonical_id":"2608.14473","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"OH Line Detections in Southern Galaxies of the IRAS Revised Bright Galaxy Sample","authors":["Han Zhao","Zhongzu Wu","Bo Zhang","Timur Mufakharov","Yongjun Chen","Zhiqiang Shen","Yulia Sotnikova"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文基于MeerKAT档案快照数据，对IRAS修订亮星系样本中186个南部星系进行了OH主线发射和吸收的系统研究，共检测到38个OH特征星系（8个OH微波激射发射，30个OH吸收），并探讨了探测率与连续谱流量、红外光度、致密分子气体条件等因素的关系。","date":"2026-08-17","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14473","score":45,"stars":2,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"galaxy gas","points":10}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas"]},{"id":"2608.12557","canonical_id":"2608.12557","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Observing Co-Located Neutral and Ionized Gas-Phase Iron Depletion in the Magellanic Clouds","authors":["Yun Qi Li","Jessica K. Werk","Caleb R. Choban","Julia Roman-Duval","Kirill Tchernyshyov","J. Xavier Prochaska","Doyeon A. Kim","Arianna S. Long"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"该研究利用HST/COS和STIS高分辨率紫外光谱，测量了麦哲伦云33条视线方向上中性气体的S和Fe元素丰度，并与文献中6个共置H II区的电离气体元素丰度进行对比。结果显示S在H II区和弥散星际介质中均几乎不亏损，但H II区的Fe丰度比相邻中性星际介质低0.3到2个数量级，表明H II区中的Fe尘粒在电离后前几百万年内能幸存下来不被破坏。","date":"2026-08-14","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.12557","score":45,"stars":2,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2608.12466","canonical_id":"2608.12466","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Why is GN-z11 Bright, Compact, and Nitrogen Enhanced? Insights from UV Absorption and Emission Diagnostics","authors":["Minami Nakane","Masami Ouchi"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"利用JWST/NIRSpec高分辨率和中分辨率光谱数据，对z=10.60的GN-z11星系UV光谱进行深度分析，发现NV、SiIV、CIV的P-Cygni轮廓及宽NIV发射，确认其紫外连续谱由大质量恒星主导而非活动星系核（AGN），并揭示致密氮富集气体区可能源于沃尔夫-拉叶星风。","date":"2026-08-14","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.12466","score":45,"stars":2,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"galaxy gas","points":10}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Other Selected Research"]}],"must_read":[{"id":"2608.15997","canonical_id":"2608.15997","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"The Koi Pond: A Strongly Lensed Protocluster Core hosting a Diverse Population of DSFGs","authors":["Nicholas Foo","Kevin C. Harrington","Brenda L. Frye","Patrick S. Kamieneski","Melanie Kaasinen","Rafael Ortiz","Alex Pigarelli","Gibson B. Bowling","Belén Alcalde Pampliega","Joe Bhangal","Timothy Carleton","Jianhang Chen","Seth H. Cohen","Camila de Sá-Freitas","Jose Diego","Román Fernández Aranda","Carlos Garcia Diaz","Nikhil Garuda","Eric F. Jiménez-Andrade","Daizhong Liu","James D. Lowenthal","Allison Man","Allison Noble","Massimo Pascale","Francesca Rizzo","Hannah R. Stacey","Amit Vishwas","Q. Daniel Wang","Rogier A. Windhorst","Ilsang Yoon","Min S. Yun","Dazhi Zhou"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文利用JWST和ALMA对强引力透镜原星系团核心PJ0846+15（\"Koi Pond\"）进行观测，揭示了11个处于z=2.67的尘埃恒星形成星系（DSFGs）的多样化性质，包括多种形态特征（旋臂、棒、核球、星团、潮汐尾）、大范围的恒星质量与尘埃消光差异，以及复杂的恒星-尘埃几何结构，表明这类星系经历了多样的演化路径。","date":"2026-08-19","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.15997","score":95,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"high-z galaxy gas","points":20}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing","Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM"]}]}